    "title": "Louisville man wins first prize at $1 Million Dollar Hole-In-One Golf Contest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "15 hours ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. — A Louisville man won $5,000 Tuesday evening after he came the closest to winning the Kentucky Derby Festival $1 Million Dollar Hole-In-One Golf Contest. Though no one aced hole #8 at Seneca Golf Course, Jeremy Milam was nearest to the pin, hitting his tee 5 feet 2 1/4 inches from the cup. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
